---
---

<section class="s approach" id="approach" style="--bg:var(--bone);--fg:var(--ink)">
  <div class="w approach-container">
    <div class="approach-header">
      <div class="header-main">
        <p class="eyebrow">How We Deliver &bull; Operating Disciplines</p>
        <h2 class="approach-title">Care in the details. Certainty in the outcomes.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="approach-aside">
        Four guiding principles govern every engagement &mdash; from the initial discovery call to 24/7 production maintenance and scale.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="approach-grid">
      <!-- 01 Quality -->
      <div class="approach-card">
        <div class="card-num-bar">
          <span class="card-num">01</span>
          <span class="card-tag">Standard</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3 class="card-heading">Uncompromising Quality</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            We sweat the edge cases so the final product feels effortless. Software goes through multi-tier testing, and data tasks pass double-blind verification.
          </p>
          <ul class="card-points">
            <li>Strict code review standards</li>
            <li>Multi-tier data verification</li>
            <li>Zero-regression mindset</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 Timelines -->
      <div class="approach-card">
        <div class="card-num-bar">
          <span class="card-num">02</span>
          <span class="card-tag">Execution</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3 class="card-heading">Committed Timelines</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Promises kept. Deadlines respected. Clear milestones and transparent sprint progress mean you never have to chase updates or wonder about launch status.
          </p>
          <ul class="card-points">
            <li>Realistic milestone planning</li>
            <li>Weekly status cadences</li>
            <li>Guaranteed SLA commitments</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 Innovation -->
      <div class="approach-card">
        <div class="card-num-bar">
          <span class="card-num">03</span>
          <span class="card-tag">Tooling</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3 class="card-heading">Modern Innovation</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Current technology, considered choices, and automation pipelines. We adopt modern architectures and workflow scripts to keep your operations agile.
          </p>
          <ul class="card-points">
            <li>Modern cloud-native stacks</li>
            <li>Automated data pipelines</li>
            <li>Continuous workflow tuning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 Client satisfaction -->
      <div class="approach-card">
        <div class="card-num-bar">
          <span class="card-num">04</span>
          <span class="card-tag">Partnership</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3 class="card-heading">Client Partnership</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Our success is entirely measured by yours. You work with a dedicated, communicative team that acts as an integrated extension of your company.
          </p>
          <ul class="card-points">
            <li>Dedicated account ownership</li>
            <li>Direct executive access</li>
            <li>Long-term scalability focus</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .approach {
    padding-block: clamp(60px, 9vh, 120px);
    background: var(--bone);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .approach-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vh, 56px);
  }
  .approach-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(20, 32, 31, 0.15);
  }
  .header-main {
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .approach-title {
    font: 800 clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.6rem)/1.05 var(--disp);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .approach-aside {
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink);
    opacity: 0.78;
  }

  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .approach-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    background: var(--teal);
    color: var(--ivory);
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .approach-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(4, 34, 43, 0.2);
  }
  .card-num-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.1);
  }
  .card-num {
    font: 800 24px/1 var(--disp);
    color: var(--tan);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .card-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(201, 162, 126, 0.14);
    color: var(--tan);
  }
  .card-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .card-heading {
    font: 700 clamp(1.3rem, 1.8vw, 1.6rem)/1.15 var(--disp);
    color: var(--ivory);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .card-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ivory);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .card-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.12);
  }
  .card-points li {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--tan);
    font-weight: 500;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .card-points li::before {
    content: "✓";
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--tan);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .approach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .approach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .approach-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
